{"id":"beerdigung","lemma":"Beerdigung","pos":"noun","rank":1588,"glosses":["burial","funeral"],"ipa":"/bəˈʔeːɐ̯dɪɡʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/68/De-Beerdigung.ogg/De-Beerdigung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Beerdigung","plural":"Beerdigungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich hasse Beerdigungen.","en":"I hate funerals.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/249890","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"hassen"},null]},{"text":"Die Beerdigung ist morgen.","en":"The funeral is tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Die Beerdigung war gestern.","en":"The funeral was yesterday.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Ich war nicht auf seiner Beerdigung.","en":"I didn't attend his funeral.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717800","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Ich gehe nicht zu Beerdigungen.","en":"I don't do funerals.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to / too"},null]}]}